<title>UK: Societe Generale sets warrants on Swire Pacific.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale sets warrants on Swire Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on Swire Pacific, lead manager Societe Generale said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    70.75 HKD		 PREMIUM	14.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.99 HKD		  GEARING	7.14 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	07.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
